# The Python service images only need lib/ + src/ (see docker/Dockerfile). Ignore
# everything else so the build context stays a few MB instead of the full ~1.1 GB repo
# (.venv, frontend/node_modules, .next, .git would otherwise be tarred + sent per build).
*
!lib
!src

# ...then re-exclude caches/junk that the lib/ + src/ re-includes would pull back in.
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.pytest_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/.DS_Store
**/*.egg-info
